      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hello!  This is not a bug report, but I think your issue is you have a recurring event setup.\n\n- Go to your group page on the website\n\n- Select VIEW on one of the events\n\n- This takes you to that specific event page, not the recurring format.\n\n- Select the View Event Series link (I'll post an image below)\n\n- On that page, you are viewing the series of events.  Click Modify Series on the right, and you can delete the series there.\n\nLet me know if this solves your issue!",
